    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1ec10fafbe9aff30f7badc1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出乎意料的是，她正在全神贯注地进行训练。她所采用的是一种朴实\n而正统的方法，这与她平日里的言行完全让人联想不到一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "489f6f14b65c04bb94d067f6b8ea5129e8ac2c53a8bc2b9ffab4f7259d4ce450",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
