    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5b82442fddadbc05c53a3ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "圣女的奥秘，终究是隐藏不住的吗。\n……好吧，这也是命运。那我就向您倾诉吧——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4699e3e78fed73f066e732f806d6e4fdb83e7792233f7d837484a9b3906d5a5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136002.json",
      "json_path": [
