    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:873a5415f5cd702e42cf9081",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——那么接下来是前几天提到过的海外研修的事。\n现在公布参加者的选拔结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b835d0122bf8c6ddda60eee77f7a99b93a115eeeca197906e800b4139f06d67",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf66983077e830a27287149e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（不不，我只不过是个凡人罢了……）",
      "source_fingerprint": "f103d9a317e50386f3fa118a30ea85a6d945e20bf89e252bee736470652e3a86",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:399283977ee122d182a70c7c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只有成绩特别优异的人才能去的海外研修……对我而言，实在与我无关。\n……明明理应很有自知之明才对，我却还是感到一阵局促不安。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a214fe7149c715976b92b372f361a4cc27d6f8120d4a13fc29c0eb0cff5c62f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
