    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d79af2d0c04ea8f8a2d120e0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呵……如果您不想说的话，那也无妨。\n不过，作为交换，我能和您聊一个小故事吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "71131976076fbb219e6bc4de90ba7982b7680844ab45569157f6d3df84fcc4c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
