    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad1ebbb031bc3e0af71343a6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这是一个，在某位少女觉醒之前的旧日往事……\n是深植于任何人内心深处的，普遍的神话——",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b03db3c60290058116a5d050f0a7576b62206e44aa88f2cdda4f8dc041349eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
