    {
      "uid": "zhcn:540e588fd5a2d142f3b5d106",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——很久很久以前，在某个地方，有一个深受宠爱的赛马娘少女。\n无论她做什么都会受到夸奖，所以她坚信自己是个特别的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c1653a10e1e89607e9d6023e253127ebaa0547bcad5650d80a8a94a0a55d255",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
