      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "红色梦想同学啊，入塾测试的成绩也相当不错呢！\n又有一位有潜力的新人加入进来，真是太让人高兴了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ab33fde447c86a73ca4908bce5d812753899c5dbaff9a120c5771b58c13060f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136003.json",
      "json_path": [
